{"format":1,"key":"zone:teldrassil","path":"/lore/zone/teldrassil","name":"Teldrassil","kind":"zone","label":"Zone","zone":{"key":"teldrassil","name":"Teldrassil","path":"/lore/zone/teldrassil"},"levels":"Levels 1-10","description":"Teldrassil, meaning 'Crown of the Earth', is a gargantuan new World Tree raised off Kalimdor's northwest coast. Grown by the druids in the wake of the…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:teldrassil","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Teldrassil, meaning 'Crown of the Earth', is a gargantuan new World Tree raised off Kalimdor's northwest coast. Grown by the druids in the wake of the Third War, its colossal boughs support an entire twilit wilderness and the night elf capital of Darnassus. Yet beneath its tranquil, moonlit canopy, a creeping corruption has begun to stir.","Teldrassil is not merely a tree; it is an elevated ecosystem standing tall amidst the waters of the Veiled Sea. Its gargantuan limbs support rolling hills, flowing rivers fed by morning dew, misty lakes, and dense ancient glades. At its western edge sits Darnassus, the grand capital of the kaldorei. At the base of its monumental trunk lies Rut'theran Village, connected to the crown above by a mystical gateway and serving as the island's primary harbor."],"hash":"9db73b","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"61248a92cc","sec":53},"female-narrator":{"sha":"45cc712a0b","sec":52}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Teldrassil (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Teldrassil_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Teldrassil","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Teldrassil"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/zone/darnassus","n":"Darnassus","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/darkshore","n":"Darkshore","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/quest/929-crown-of-the-earth","n":"Crown of the Earth","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/940-teldrassil","n":"Teldrassil","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/npc/fandral-staghelm","n":"Fandral Staghelm","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/tyrande-whisperwind","n"